{"id":"ytr9y166vf21jy5vnwkfbma2x","title":"Firefox 安全与隐私季度更新","originalTitle":"Firefox Security & Privacy Newsletter 2026 Q3","summary":"Firefox 从 2026 年 9 月起加快了更新速度，引入了更多安全修复和隐私保护功能。Firefox 157 版本开始显示 TLS 连接警告，增强用户隐私保护。Firefox 153 版本增加了内置容器功能，帮助用户隔离不同活动，减少跟踪。Mozilla 还在 TU Delft 举办了安全研究峰会，讨论网络应用安全挑战。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://attackanddefense.dev/2026/11/02/firefox-security-and-privacy-newsletter-q3.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-03T08:03:58.461Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-03T08:16:34.548Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-03T08:16:34.548Z","category":"security-privacy","tags":["版本发布","安全漏洞","性能提升","许可证变更","GitHub"],"score":30,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"supply-chain-security","name":"供应链与依赖安全"},{"slug":"major-release","name":"重大版本发布"},{"slug":"performance","name":"性能与基准"},{"slug":"security-fix","name":"安全修复与漏洞"},{"slug":"license-change","name":"许可证与治理"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}